  "body": "Hi @reillyeon \r\n I am using Webusb to develop my new project and my device cannot access the Internet at this time. I want landing Page to point to a local HTML file that supports Webusb, so I try to set bscheme to 0xFF according to your [document](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#url-descriptor).\r\nThen set the URL to file:///path_to_file.html.\r\nUnfortunately, Chrome will not show a persistent notification when the USB device is plugged in, even the URL is HTTPS file.\r\n\r\nIf I change bScheme to 1 or 0(according to the [policy and mechanism](https://www.chromium.org/Home/chromium-security/deprecating-powerful-features-on-insecure-origins/)), Chrome will show notifications normally.\r\n",
